      "name": "grilling",
      "description": "Interview the user in rounds about a plan, decision or design until every branch is resolved \u2014 mapping the decision tree, asking each round's unblocked questions together, and recommending an answer to each. Use when asked to grill me, stress-test a plan, poke holes in a design, pressure-test an idea, or challenge thinking before committing to it. Dispatches sub-agents to look up facts rather than asking for them.",
